{"run_id": "5130267a", "ts": "2026-10-25T00:48:08", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "effort": "low", "cell": "L", "corpus_tokens": 64684, "round": 5, "question_id": "planning-actions", "kind": "commitment", "cache_state": "warm", "cache_observed": "warm", "ok": true, "failure_kind": "", "error": "", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "latency_s": 7.379, "total_s": 7.467, "tokens": {"input": 22, "cache_write": 0, "cache_read": 64690, "output": 1515}, "cost_usd": 0.001407, "task_success": true, "failed_checks": [], "citations": {"ok": 8, "weak": 0, "bad": 0}, "uncited_missing": 0, "numbers": {"checked": 6, "flagged": 1}, "request_id": "req_011CgNaz4auukSoWsyHZLDNb", "flagged_numbers": [{"value": "3rd", "status": "elsewhere", "where": "Product planning call, Speaker 1, 00:00"}], "answer": "The recap at the end of the **Product planning call** (Project Lighthouse) assigned these action items:\n\n- **Speaker 1:** Send the final scope document by Friday. [Product planning call, Speaker 1, 06:30]\n- **Marcus (Speaker 2):** Deliver the API spec by October 30th, and build the rollback switch before launch. [Product planning call, Speaker 1, 06:30]\n- **Dana (Speaker 3):** Finish the high-fidelity mockups by November 1st. [Product planning call, Speaker 1, 06:30]\n- **Leo (Speaker 4):** Draft the beta announcement email by November 2nd and brief support. [Product planning call, Speaker 1, 06:30]\n- **Second tester:** Starts November 4th. The recap does not name an owner. [Product planning call, Speaker 1, 06:30]\n\nTwo related items were assigned earlier in the call but were not repeated in the recap:\n- Marcus was asked to add the tracking snippet during beta setup. He said he would do it the week of November 3rd. [Product planning call, Speaker 1, 04:50] and [Product planning call, Speaker 2, 05:05]\n- Leo was to ask support to join the beta kickoff on November 3rd and send them a short guide beforehand. [Product planning call, Speaker 4, 06:05]\n\nI took \"planning call\" to mean the Product planning call because it is the only one with a closing recap of action items. Several other meetings have \"planning\" in the title, such as Event planning, Newsletter planning and Office move planning, but they have no such recap."}
